\end{align*}

Let $x_{k}=\cos \theta_{k}$. Then $x_{k+1}=\frac{1}{2} x_{k}^{2}+x_{k}-\frac{1}{2}$ for $0 \leq k \leq N-1$.

Let $y_{k}=\frac{1}{2}\left(x_{k}+1\right)$. Then $y_{k+1}=\frac{1}{2} y_{k}^{2}$ for $0 \leq k \leq N-1$.

